Our episodes deal with serious and often distressing incidents. If you feel at any time you need support, please contact your local crisis centre. For suggested phone numbers for confidential support, please see the show notes for this episode on your app or on our website. In 1993, breaking news in the small northern Indiana city of La Port always seemed to be from Chicago or South Bend. Nothing shocking ever happened in La Port. With 22,000 people there was hardly a report of any serious crime that involved one of

